                                "sense_id": "91857bbb-a5e3-3a6d-855e-406a0b625d65",
                                "text": "In spite of his parsonical black, and that other well-known clerical disguise, a bad case of Pulpit's Disease, the \"king of tears\" cuts a more dashing figure than the Rake, and the role is by a long shot the stageworthiest in the opera."
